{"frontline":"mod","format":1,"id":"history-1821","kind":"scenario","version":"1.0","author":"Frontline","minGame":"3.3.0","title":"1821: The Greek War of Independence","year":1821,"date":"1821-03-25","tagline":"25 March 1821 · Greece rises against the Ottomans","description":"The Greeks of the Morea raise the flag of revolution against the Ottoman Empire. The Holy Alliance of Russia, Austria and Prussia keeps watch over a restored Europe, Spanish America is breaking free, and Muhammad Ali's Egypt grows into a power of its own.","gdpScale":0.015,"popScale":0.13,"intro":["📜 25 March 1821 — Bishop Germanos raises the banner of revolution at Agia Lavra. The Greek War of Independence has begun.","⚔ Ali Pasha of Ioannina is in open revolt in Epirus, tying down the Sultan's armies.","⚔ Also burning: the Spanish American wars of independence, as Mexico, Gran Colombia, Chile and the Río de la Plata fight Spain.","💡 Free Greece: select the Greek Revolutionaries and hold the Morea — or call on Russia, Britain and France for help."],"states":[{"code":"OTT","name":"Ottoman Empire","take":["TUR","CYP","CYN","GRC","BGR","MKD","ALB","BIH","KOS","ROU","SYR","LBN","ISR","PSX","JOR","IRQ"],"s":[35,24,1.2,135,80,20,0.5,0,1],"form":"ottoman","cap":["Constantinople","Istanbul"],"color":[52,105,80],"continent":"Asia"},{"code":"GRK","name":"Greek Revolutionaries","take":[],"s":[1.5,0.9,0.12,50,90,14,0.85,0,1],"flag":{"pattern":"cross","colors":["#0d5eaf","#ffffff"],"emblem":"none"},"cap":"Kalamata","capAt":[22.11,37.04],"color":[60,120,210],"continent":"Europe"},{"code":"YAN","name":"Pashalik of Yanina","take":[],"s":[1.5,0.8,0.1,25,15,2,0.65,0,1],"flag":{"pattern":"plain","colors":["#7a1f2b"],"emblem":"crescent","emblemColor":"#fcd116"},"cap":["Ioannina"],"capAt":[20.85,39.67],"continent":"Europe"},{"code":"SRB","name":"Principality of Serbia","take":["SRB"],"s":[1,0.6,0.05,15,15,0,0.6,0,1],"flag":{"pattern":"h3","colors":["#c8102e","#0b3d91","#ffffff"],"emblem":"none"},"cap":"Belgrade",